<title>UK: Land Securities up on talk of good outlook.</title>
<headline>Land Securities up on talk of good outlook.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Land Securities Plc rose on Monday after recent positive analyst comment on the stock and amid talk of buoyant prospects in UK property, especially in central London where demand has been strong, traders said.</p>
<p>At 1206 GMT, Land Securities was up 6-1/2p at 743-1/2.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been some positive comment and talk that the sector is improving,&quot; one trader said. Last week analysts at HSBC James Capel reiterated their positive stance on Land Securities.</p>
<p>-- Brian Killen, London newsroom 44 171 542 7972</p>
